# Frontend Rules

## Stack

React + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Chart.js

## Public Pages (no auth)

Landing (hero, about, services, packages, testimonials, contact, book now), booking form, budget recommendations display.

## Protected Pages (JWT required)

Staff dashboard, admin dashboard, analytics, reports, user management.

Use a route guard component that checks JWT and role before rendering.

## Components

- Extract reusable UI into `client/src/components/`
- Page-level layouts in `client/src/pages/`
- API calls in `client/src/services/` — never inline fetch in every component

## Booking Form Fields

Name, contact number, email, event type, event date, number of guests, budget, preferred package, additional requests. Validate before submit.

## Charts

Use Chart.js for analytics views (monthly revenue, peak periods, popular packages/services).
